<section class="gg-support-hero">
  <div class="gg-container gg-support-hero-grid">
    <div>
      <span class="gg-kicker">Support Goal Grower</span>
      <h1>Help build a calmer way to grow.</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-support-hero-note">
      <p>
        Goal Grower is still in development. Your support helps with testing,
        design, app store prep, future features, and keeping the project moving.
      </p>
      <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-btn">Support the Project</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-support-mission">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-support-mission-panel">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Why support matters</span>
      <h2>This is more than a goal tracker.</h2>
      <p>
        Goal Grower is being built to make progress feel human, visual, and
        easier to return to. Support helps turn the beta into a polished app
        people can actually use every day.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-support-options">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-section-heading">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Ways to support</span>
      <h2>Choose what fits you.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-support-option-grid">
      <a href="/pages/contact" class="gg-support-option">
        <span>01</span>
        <h3>Become a beta tester</h3>
        <p>Try the app, share feedback, and help improve the experience before launch.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-support-option featured">
        <span>02</span>
        <h3>Support development</h3>
        <p>Help fund design, testing, app store setup, and future features.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-support-option">
        <span>03</span>
        <h3>Shop products</h3>
        <p>Buy digital tools, merch, or future products that help fund the build.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-support-roadmap">
  <div class="gg-container gg-support-roadmap-grid">
    <div>
      <span class="gg-kicker light">What support helps with</span>
      <h2>Every bit moves the app forward.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-roadmap-list">
      <div>
        <strong>Testing</strong>
        <span>Finding bugs and improving confusing screens.</span>
      </div>

      <div>
        <strong>Design polish</strong>
        <span>Making the app feel clearer, calmer, and more motivating.</span>
      </div>

      <div>
        <strong>App store launch</strong>
        <span>Preparing screenshots, listing content, testing, and release steps.</span>
      </div>

      <div>
        <strong>Future features</strong>
        <span>Improving shared gardens, reminders, widgets, and goal systems.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-support-final">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-support-final-card">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Thank you</span>
      <h2>Support the garden while it grows.</h2>
      <p>
        Whether you test, share feedback, or support financially, you are helping
        Goal Grower become a better app for real people with real goals.
      </p>

      <div class="gg-hero-actions center">
        <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-btn">Support Now</a>
        <a href="/pages/contact" class="gg-btn-soft">Join Testing</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Goal Grower Support",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Goal Grower Support"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}